WEBVTT

00:06:28.426 --> 00:06:32.596
of always women have to be
the ones that get quiet

00:06:32.638 --> 00:06:35.182
and men speak up
even when they say nonsense.

00:06:37.143 --> 00:06:41.605
FO: The Batonga Foundation, it creates
opportunities for women and girls.

00:06:41.605 --> 00:06:43.691
It creates a future for them.

00:06:43.732 --> 00:06:45.943
It sounds easy, though, to say that:

00:06:45.985 --> 00:06:48.487
creates opportunities
for women and girls, easy.

00:06:48.487 --> 00:06:49.822
But it's not.

00:06:50.406 --> 00:06:55.703
Can you give us an example
of your advocacy work

00:06:55.744 --> 00:06:58.914
that has been difficult

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:00.708
but you've worked through it